{"id": "DfZzW11x_cx", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Shubh Dhanteras 🪔 Did you know Dhanteras is the day Lord Dhanvantari rose from the ocean carrying the pot of amrit?\n\nWhen the devas and asuras churned the ocean of milk, Maa Lakshmi rose from it, and last of all came Dhanvantari, the physician of the gods, with the kalash of amrit in his hands (Bhagavata Purana 8.8). That is why Dhanteras is a prayer for health as much as for wealth: Lakshmi for prosperity, Dhanvantari for a long and healthy life. And on this evening a lamp is lit at the door for Yama, so that no one in the home meets an untimely death (Padma Purana).\n\nMay Maa Lakshmi and Lord Dhanvantari bless your home with health, wealth and light. 🙏\n\n✨ Send this to your family group and wish everyone a Shubh Dhanteras.\n💬 Comment 🪔 if you are lighting the Yama deepak tonight.\n📚 Our Navadurga Set of picture books for children is out now. Link in bio (rishikatha.com).\nFollow @therishikatha for the stories behind every festival.\n\n#Dhanteras #HappyDhanteras #ShubhDhanteras #Dhanvantari #MaaLakshmi Lakshmi Diwali2026 HappyDiwali Deepavali Dhantrayodashi YamaDeepam HinduFestival SanatanDharma IndianFestival RishiKatha", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793974781, "like_count": 656, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-998983579936022a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 77.336, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP8aEF_HyGLGaemRX8YUUa7qafWrdc-aVbqU30QLXHNnxLD3MOCI98ZmkcodEXHifL6FjgJkugZyE_PzmGdHPGwjvEASi30biExgFc.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoZGlM9o3dZG51_dkviXRyHx916vGvXCH3RKbu8JGrUExTvFnC4aZT53Y1WM8GyhwstmFXISjGT_eTGznVHe9Go&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=0psyoadZqc8Q7kNvwFisJ51&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_